    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "（相変わらず、綺麗な音色）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "（でも。いつでも伯父さんの奏でる音は、とても寂しそう）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "（……仕方ない。あまり、演奏の邪魔をしたくないのだけど）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「伯父さん」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「驚かせて、すみません。演奏、つづけても構いませんよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「わたしのことなら、お気遣いなく。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「伯父さんが読唇術をおぼえたように、わたしも適応する努力をしていますから。この、優しくない世界に」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「はい。これから登校するので、ご挨拶をと。今日は月曜日ですよ、伯父さん。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「たまには新聞やカレンダーも見ないと、世間の流れから取り残されてしまいますよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「……生意気でした、すみません。わたしが言えた義理でも、ないですよね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「そうですか？　最近、表情が柔らかくなったって……そうでしょうか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「はい、近ごろちょっと学校も楽しい……気がします。だから、あまり心配しないでくださいね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「それと。今日の天気予報は大雨だったので、外出する際には気をつけてくださいね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「何か用事があるなら、わたし早く帰ってきて伯父さんの介助を……はい？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「……ふぅん。お母さんが、わたしに会いたがっていると？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「何を言ってるんですか、伯父さん。わたしに、お母さんなんていませんよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-child",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-child_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 418
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "set_background",
    "display_name": "空",
    "id": "2007",
    "timezone": "4"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「おかあさぁん……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-child",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-child_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 418
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「どこ？　どこにいるの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-child",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-child_expression/cry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 418
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「わからない、こわいよぉ……。耳が痛い、痛いの。おかあさん、どこ？　たすけて！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「耳が痛い、痛いの！　雨の音で、何も聞こえない！　おかあさんの声が聞こえないよぉ、こわい！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「そらを見つけて！　ここにいるよ！　名前を呼んで！　こわいよぉ、耳が痛い！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「どこにいるの？　そらを独りにしないで、名前を呼んで！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「見つけて、抱きしめてよ！　さむいよ、こわいよ、さびしいよぉ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「おかあさん、おかあさぁん……！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-default",
