  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「…………」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「……すみません。すこし、『ぼうっ』としていました」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「雨が、苦手なんです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「気圧のせい、でしょうか。雨が降りそうっていうだけで、憂鬱になります」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「大丈夫です。わかっています、今日は早めに帰りますね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「お母さん、ずっと面会謝絶だったから……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「いま会っておかないと、次はないかもしれませんし。わたしの顔も、忘れられちゃうかも」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「わたしだって、もうよくお母さんの顔を思いだせない……。親子じゃない、みたいに。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「だって、わたしはお母さんに抱きしめてもらったこともない」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "「……遅刻しそうなので、出発しますね。行ってきます、伯父さん」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "（あぁ……。ほんとうに、憂鬱）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "（うっかり傘を忘れたふりをして、『雨宿りしていた』って言い訳して……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "（病院の面会時間が終わる、遅い時刻まで帰らなくてもいいかな）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "（お母さんに、会いたくない）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "（そんな我が侭は、言えない。伯父さんは、わたしのことを実の娘みたいに愛してくれている。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "（たとえ、わたしを『お母さんの身代わり人形』だと思っているとしても）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "（あぁ……。社会は、世界は、面倒くさい。雁字搦めになって、身動きがとれなくて、とても不自由）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 31,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "（雨が、つまらない世界も……。わたし自身も、洗い流してくれたらいいのに）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "（そんなのは、非現実的な願望。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "そら",
    "text": "（雨なんて、ただの物理現象。神秘はない、つまらない……。うるさい雨音で、耳が、頭が痛くなるだけ）"
  },
  {
